GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "2BF2E0F973A5773E"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{1080F3453ADC3799}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "I. Situation"
     m_sContent "DTL: 15/10/2005, 1100hr, Chernarus."\
     ""\
     "For the past week our glorious Chernarussian Movement of the Red Star has been suffering under a massive combined US and CDF offensive. Our unit has been ordered to conduct a delaying action at the dilapidated town of Hamertin which sits atop a vital road junction, this is in order to buy time for friendly forces further west to regroup and reorganize. The majority of our infantry force has been concentrated in and around the town, although a number of smaller units have been deployed forward and to the flanks."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{530C1390F514FC86}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "I. Situation"
     m_sContent "DTL: 15/10/2005, 1100hr, Chernarus."\
     ""\
     "For the past week US and Chernarussian government forces have been conducting a combined offensive against the Russian backed separatist group known as the “Chernarussian Movement of the Red Star” or ChDKZ. As part of this offensive our stryker mechanized infantry platoon has been tasked with assaulting the separatist held dilapidated town of Hamertin, which is located along an important road junction. Due to the rapid pace of the ongoing offensive only limited preliminary reconnaissance has been conducted. We have an accurate idea as to the total strength and equipment of hostile forces, but little to no knowledge of their exact location in the AO beyond the assumption that they will be concentrated in and around Hamertin itself due to its abundant cover and concealment."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{87BC4BE13F435DCC}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "II. Mission"
     m_sContent "Sufficiently delay or outright prevent the capture of Hamertin for at least 50 minutes."\
     ""\
     "If we are unable to hold the town then we should retreat to the west. Our most vital piece of equipment is our BMP-1P and its Konkurs ATGM, in the event of a retreat the survival of it and its crew should be prioritized."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{039B1832251A35EE}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "II. Mission"
     m_sContent "We are to assault and occupy the town of Hamertin, securing it and its vital road junction for follow on forces. It is not required that we eliminate all separatist forces in the AO, but Hamertin and its immediate surroundings must be cleared. We must achieve this objective within 50 minutes in order to maintain the rapid pace of the ongoing offensive, which has so far prevented any substantial regrouping of separatist forces."\
     ""\
     "Should we succeed in occupying Hamertin on time we should then prevent as much as possible the westward retreat of local separatist forces, most importantly their BMP-1P which is a significant threat due to its Konkors ATGM. Regardless of if separatists forces successfully retreat we will still achieve victory if Hamertin has been captured on time."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{48926404D521250C}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "III. Friendly Forces"
     m_sContent "Sec I. Composition & Strength"\
     "Our overall unit consists of roughly 3x platoons worth of irregular infantry, dispersed throughout the AO but primarily concentrated around Hamertin itself. The rough location of our various sub units have been marked. Our units are equipped with Soviet and Russian small arms, wear a wide variety of uniform patterns and camouflage, and have little if any PPE."\
     ""\
     "Sec II. Vehicles & Assets."\
     "Multiple PKM and NSV fighting positions around Hamertin, these are already manned and have been marked. Assuming our crew hasn't been killed or otherwise lost we are equiped 1x BMP-1P (Konkurs ATGM). We have 2x UAZ452 vans."\
     ""\
     "Sec III. Support & Resupply"\
     "No external support or resupply is available. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E20E56AAD271BD70}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "III. Friendly Forces"
     m_sContent "Sec I. Composition & Strength"\
     "Our Stryker mechanized infantry platoon is the only friendly force in the AO. Consists of 1x platoon HQ, 2x rifle squads, and 1x weapons squad (2x CarlG, 2x M240). Currently located at a staging area SE side of the AO along an ASR."\
     ""\
     "Sec II. Vehicles & Assets"\
     "3x M1126 Stryker APC with: slat armor, CROWS M2HB1"\
     "1x M1151 uparmored Humvee with: M2HB1"\
     ""\
     "Sec III. Support & Resupply"\
     "There is no external support or resupply available."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A1CCF95A29FD7726}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "IV. Enemy Forces"
     m_sContent "Sec I. Composition & Strength"\
     "1x Stryker mechanized infantry platoon, believed to be the only hostile force in the AO. Consists of 1x platoon HQ, 2x rifle squads, and 1x weapons squad (2x CarlG, 2x M240). Currently located somewhere to the south east, preparing to assault Hamertin."\
     ""\
     "Sec II. Vehicles & Assets"\
     "3x M1126 Stryker APC with: slat armor, CROWS M2HB1"\
     "1x M1151 uparmored Humvee with: M2HB1"\
     ""\
     "Sec III. Support & Resupply"\
     "No hostile external support or resupply is expected."\
     ""\
     "Sec IV. MLCOA"\
     "Set up a base of fire along a portion of the high ground SE of Hamertin, followed by a rapid assault covered by said high ground making use of the mobility and protection provided by the Stryker APCs. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{6EE92864EE628235}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "IV. Enemy Forces"
     m_sContent "Sec I. Composition & Strength"\
     "Roughly 3x platoons worth of irregular infantry, dispersed throughout the AO but expected to be primarily concentrated around Hamertin itself. Equiped with little to no PPE."\
     ""\
     "Sec II. Vehicles & Assets"\
     "Multiple PKM and NSV fighting positions, exact locations unknown. 1x BMP-1P (Konkurs ATGM). Multiple GAZ 452s for the transportation of troops and supplies."\
     ""\
     "Sec III. Support & Resupply"\
     "No hostile external support or resupply is expected."\
     ""\
     "Sec IV. MLCOA"\
     "Concentrate force around Hamertin while deploying smaller units to ambush and delay along approaches to town. Contest high ground to the south east of Hamertin with long range fire from NSV hmgs and BMP-1P (Konkurs ATGM)."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{DD4A70D4B76F1D7D}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "V. Comsig"
     m_sContent "Sec I. Callsigns"\
     "Fire Team - 1'2"\
     "BMP-1P - 1'3"\
     ""\
     "Sec II. Radio Nets"\
     "Overall - 42Mhz"\
     "BMP Internal - 43Mhz"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{8B04003BDC4CF7C9}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "V. Comsig"
     m_sContent "Sec I. Callsigns"\
     "Platoon Leader - 1'6A"\
     "Platoon Seargant - 1'6B"\
     "Platoon HQ - 1'6"\
     "1st Rifle Squad - 1'1"\
     "	1st Stryker	-	1'1V"\
     "2nd Rifle Squad - 1'2"\
     "	2nd Stryker 	-	1'2V"\
     "Weapons Squad - 1'3"\
     "	3rd Stryker	-	1'3V"\
     ""\
     "Sec II. Radio Nets"\
     "Platoon Net- 42Mhz"\
     "HQ - 38.0Mhz"\
     "1'1 - 38.2Mhz"\
     "1'2 - 38.4Mhz"\
     "1'3 - 38.6Mhz"
     m_aFactionKeys {
